d": "134778495298719", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982471_134778498632052_411711373724603695_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_lgHmio2l7cQ7kNvwHmU4PJ&_nc_oc=AdpAgj59y6hCQ6hKOux5-QnNwOaJ0c9XwQ6DgHbV_-EPdHRSADEGYOqrU0GJFDuyMgM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af974rHS9sxf0IwZhb-QulXDCWW-ygSaHwjTmqcon7MceA&oe=6A341F64"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "798605747754490", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982483_798605754421156_1986649763789961237_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=whQf4-wRTZcQ7kNvwHUf2pV&_nc_oc=AdpRXn0Fm57BRp378iH653zjd-j0CHaRAN2OObg5QtQPnRgD8JOvPmcUhIXKako5Kew&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-ytVAstUcXqDTRdjGtAEvaWlSvsCl-eOCNJWdwyfzX8A&oe=6A3400E5"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "263294812157372", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035358_263294815490705_4150129998500296228_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gddNf2tBw7YQ7kNvwGOAtfX&_nc_oc=Adps8-h5c-leYrjo22qCI4OmNudCVzD4c5FrqgVANktKQfAow5p-jZ_N1vV_QZvRsLI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8fQgP6sWv_gQ-4EcKBK5nAzZ_BxLBvydScWEFaU3-AvQ&oe=6A3413A7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Modulia Quest - screenshot.png", "id": "522084335580003", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982449_522084338913336_7694930828877611739_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=urh20a-9vcYQ7kNvwF5FJnv&_nc_oc=AdoAqKagp3u22YRvTsgAaxBfzUi9dKWy20LlmWFmFmWSQS0vvVmqf9tx5uDrwqu_7CI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_u5te9DrWVn69xgsmp8fz9HKTN3XjEgjSrPU4cth5MYA&oe=6A340491"}, "display_name": "Modulia Studio", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Modulia Studio is a VR MIDI controller. \n\nIt allows you to wirelessly control any MIDI-compatible software and has an especially deep integration with Ableton Live\u2122 10 & 11. It also features a standalone mode with embedded sounds.\n\nBuild your custom studio using the 11 different modules:\n\n- Session (controls the session view of Live\u2122)\n- Circular Keyboard (a beautiful 360\u00b0 keyboard)\n- Scale Keyboard (a versatile scaled keyboard)\n- Expressive Keyboard (a MIDI-MPE keyboard for expressive performances)\n- Remote (remotely triggers multiple notes and visual effects at once)\n- Pads (a 4x4 pads grid)\n- Cube Mixer (a 3D mixing space)\n- Cylinder Mixer (a cylindrical 3D mixing space)\n- Knobs (4 configurable knobs)\n- Sliders (4 configurable sliders)\n- FX (visual effects)\n\nDownload Modulia Desktop for MacOS and Windows to connect Modulia Studio to your MIDI software: www.modulia-studio.com/get-modulia-studio/#desktop \n\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nAbleton\u00ae and Live\u2122 are trademarks of Ableton AG.", "short_description": "Modulia Studio is a VR MIDI controller. \n\nIt lets you wirelessly control any MIDI-compatible software and has a deep integration with Ableton Live\u2122 10 & 11. It also features a standalone mode with embedded sounds.\n\nBuild your studio using the 11 different modules:\n\n- Session\n- Circular Keyboard\n- Scale Keyboard\n- Expressive Keyboard\n- Remote\n- Pads\n- Cube Mixer\n- Cylinder Mixer\n- Knobs\n- Sliders\n- FX\n\nGet Modulia Desktop to connect Modulia Studio to your MIDI software at www.modulia-studio.com "}]}, "developer_name": "Th\u00e9r\u00e9mix Tech", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.modulia-studio.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Th\u00e9r\u00e9mix Tech", "support_website_url": "https://www.modulia-studio.com/documentation/", "website_url": "https://www.modulia-studio.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", 